    {
      "id": "claim_48a9ac69352d44a3a4b26a310db581a5",
      "statement": "Schema changes go only in a new db/migrations/*.sql file (db/init/02_schema.sql is the fresh-database baseline) together with the new table's RLS policies; reaching the Ask agent requires a line in backend/app/agent/tools/sql/catalog.py, which is a security decision; and the migration is recorded in docs/CHANGELOG.md followed by make wiki-update, with the rules themselves living in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §7 and §8.",
